      "subject": "כאשר תמצא ידך",
      "rationale": "Hibru tok: 'olsem han bilong yu bai painim' — em i bilong tok 'olsem inap bilong yu', tasol mi holim piksa bilong han."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ופשטת",
      "rationale": "Hibru tok i tok bilong spredim ol man long pait — mi tanim 'ran wantaim ol i go long', olsem tupela hap i lusliklik."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨em⟩",
      "rationale": "Tok Pisin i nidim wanpela tok bilong skruim 'ran wantaim ol i go long taun'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na long moning, taim san i kirap, yu ken kirap bipo, na yu ken ran wantaim ol i go long ⟨em⟩ taun; na lukim, em na ol man i stap wantaim ⟨את⟩ em, ol i kamaut i go long yu, na yu ken mekim long em olsem han bilong yu bai painim.",
